  (text "USB-C J1\nNative USB Serial/JTAG (Full-Speed) on GPIO13/14 for flashing and logs; no USB-UART bridge.\nCC 5.1k Rd = sink. Shell tied to GND.\nD2 + D5 TVS on the two VBUS contact groups, then F1 PTC; VBUS feeds only the U4 LDO.\nDESIGN_NOTES.md §4."
    (at 71.12 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "dee94b89-6179-472c-85a0-0e4891ae11d1")
  )
  (text "ROUTING - USB\nJ1 -> U2 (flow-through, all four data contacts) -> join -> R5/R6 -> module on L1; the D+ join takes one short L4 hop with GND return vias; a D- serpentine matches both plug orientations.\nD2/D5 right at the J1 VBUS contacts, U2 right at the data contacts, short GND vias. Pair 0.19mm / 0.31mm gap (89-90R diff with mask, field solver); Full-Speed."
    (at 71.12 208.28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 255 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "83f00611-471d-4f94-943c-bd6c5c40e6e1")
  )
